    "body": "## Security remediation candidate (multi-CVE)\n\nThis PR was generated by an automated, deterministic remediation pipeline. It proposes 2 version bumps in the same file, each for a dependency flagged by a security scanner.\n\n**This is a remediation candidate, not confirmation that the vulnerabilities are resolved.** Final verification happens on the next scanner re-scan.\n\n| Advisory | Package | Installed version | Target version |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| CVE-2022-31692 | org.springframework.security:spring-security-core | 5.6.4 | 5.6.9 |\n| CVE-2022-38752 | org.yaml:snakeyaml | 1.29 | 1.32 |\n\nCandidate identity: `0b27c921d9ca50486a3a0c6fd8a0a13acb53546d586a885d6d6b132d2f790547`",
